#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_House1/scripts.inc:31
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_House1_Text_DevelopedThisTM"
msgid ""
"For thirty years I've remained in\n"
"SOOTOPOLIS honing my skills.\p"
"I developed a shattering TM.\n"
"I bequeath it to you!$"
msgstr ""
"三十年来，我一直留在琉璃市\n"
"磨练自己的技艺。\p"
"我开发出了一个威力惊人的\n"
"招式学习器。就传授给你吧！$"

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_House1/scripts.inc:37
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_House1_Text_ExplainBrickBreak"
msgid ""
"TM31 contains BRICK BREAK! It's a move\n"
"so horrible that I can't describe it.$"
msgstr ""
"招式学习器31里装的是劈瓦！\n"
"这个招式可怕得让我无法形容。$"

